Privacy Policy
Effective date: July 29, 2026
Kindred (“Kindred,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) provides an AI-powered application that lets you create personalities and have conversations with them. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use and share it, and the choices available to you.
Information We Collect
Information you provide
When you use Kindred, you may provide:
Messages and other content you submit during conversations
Personality names, traits, instructions, backstories, and saved memories
Your name if you choose to sign in with Apple
Information included in support requests or other communications with us
Please avoid submitting highly sensitive information that you would not want processed by an AI service.
Account information
If you use Sign in with Apple, we receive an Apple-provided account identifier and, if you choose to share it, your name. Apple may provide a private relay email address depending on your Sign in with Apple settings.
Device and usage information
We may collect or generate:
A randomly generated device identifier
Account and session identifiers
Daily message counts and subscription status
Basic technical information needed to operate, secure, and troubleshoot the service
IP address and request information that may be processed automatically by our hosting provider
We do not use this information to track you across apps or websites owned by other companies.
Purchases
Subscriptions are purchased and managed through Apple’s App Store. Apple processes your payment information. We receive limited information needed to confirm your subscription status, but we do not receive your full payment-card details.
How Your Conversations Are Handled
Your personalities and conversation history are stored locally on your device unless otherwise stated in the app.
When you send a message, Kindred transmits information needed to generate a response, which may include:
Your recent messages
The selected personality’s settings and instructions
Memories you have chosen to associate with that personality
The AI model you selected
This information is sent through Kindred’s service to OpenRouter and the selected AI model provider. These providers process the information to generate a response and may handle it according to their own terms and privacy policies.
Kindred’s server does not intentionally store the text of your conversations after processing the request. However, infrastructure and AI providers may temporarily process or retain request data for security, abuse prevention, debugging, or legal compliance.
How We Use Information
We use information to:
Provide AI-generated responses
Save your preferences and conversations on your device
Authenticate accounts and maintain sessions
Apply free-message limits and subscription benefits
Process and restore subscriptions
Maintain the safety, reliability, and security of Kindred
Diagnose technical problems
Respond to support requests
Comply with legal obligations and enforce our terms
We do not sell your personal information or use your conversations for targeted advertising.
How We Share Information
We may share information with:
Apple, for authentication, subscriptions, and App Store services
OpenRouter, to route requests to your selected AI model
AI model providers, to generate responses
Cloud and infrastructure providers, to host, secure, and operate Kindred
Professional advisers or authorities, when reasonably necessary to comply with law, protect rights and safety, or respond to valid legal requests
A successor organization, if Kindred is involved in a merger, acquisition, financing, or sale of assets
We share only the information reasonably necessary for these purposes.
Data Retention
Personalities and conversation history stored locally remain on your device until you delete them, clear a conversation, remove the app, or erase the app’s data.
We retain account identifiers, names, subscription information, and usage records for as long as reasonably necessary to provide the service, maintain security, meet legal obligations, and resolve disputes.
Support communications may be retained for as long as reasonably necessary to handle your request and maintain business records.
Third-party providers may follow their own retention practices.
Your Choices and Rights
You can:
Clear conversations from within the app
Delete locally saved personalities and memories
Choose whether to sign in with Apple
Manage or cancel subscriptions through your Apple ID settings
Request access to, correction of, or deletion of personal information associated with your account by contacting us
To submit a privacy request, email [your privacy/support email]. We may need to verify your identity before completing certain requests.
Your rights may vary depending on where you live. Where required by applicable law, you may also have the right to restrict or object to processing, obtain a portable copy of your information, or appeal our response.
Data Security
We use reasonable administrative, technical, and organizational safeguards designed to protect information. However, no electronic transmission or storage system is completely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.
Children’s Privacy
Kindred is not intended for children under 13, or under the minimum age required in their country to consent to the processing of personal information. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children below the applicable age. If you believe a child has provided us with personal information, contact us so we can take appropriate action.
International Data Processing
Kindred and its service providers may process information in countries other than the country where you live. Those countries may have different data-protection laws. Where required, we use appropriate safeguards for international transfers.
Third-Party Services
Kindred depends on third-party services, including Apple, OpenRouter, hosting providers, and AI model providers. Their handling of information is governed by their respective privacy policies. We encourage you to review those policies before submitting sensitive information.
Changes to This Policy
We may update this Privacy Policy as Kindred changes. We will update the effective date and provide additional notice when required by law. Your continued use of Kindred after an updated policy takes effect means the updated policy will apply to future use.
